1
00:00:07,632 --> 00:00:08,466
What the...?

2
00:00:09,342 --> 00:00:10,635
That dream just now...

3
00:00:12,846 --> 00:00:14,889
Ugh... I must be going crazy!

4
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:23,773
- Her breath

5
00:00:24,649 --> 00:00:25,442
- Her fingertips

6
00:00:26,693 --> 00:00:27,986
- Her voice

7
00:00:28,653 --> 00:00:29,571
- And then

8
00:00:30,822 --> 00:00:31,865
- Her lips

9
00:00:36,244 --> 00:00:37,662
Get a grip!

10
00:01:04,272 --> 00:01:06,608
Drinking in the morning?

11
00:01:06,858 --> 00:01:08,318
Yeah, why?

12
00:01:09,486 --> 00:01:11,946
Oh, it's just... it's morning, that's all.

13
00:01:13,364 --> 00:01:16,618
So what, is there a law saying you can't drink in the morning?

14
00:01:17,911 --> 00:01:18,620
No, not really...

15
00:01:19,412 --> 00:01:20,288
Then it's fine.

16
00:01:23,666 --> 00:01:24,209
Um...

17
00:01:25,418 --> 00:01:26,252
Did we, by any chance...

18
00:01:27,629 --> 00:01:28,838
Last night...

19
00:01:29,756 --> 00:01:30,840
Last night what?

20
00:01:33,635 --> 00:01:35,929
Ah, never mind.

21
00:01:39,849 --> 00:01:41,851
Oh, I gotta go.

22
00:01:43,311 --> 00:01:44,229
Where are you going?

23
00:01:44,479 --> 00:01:45,146
Work.

24
00:01:45,522 --> 00:01:46,272
Why?

25
00:01:46,940 --> 00:01:49,025
Oh, it’s nothing.

26
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,848
Hey, Jiwoo.

27
00:02:21,099 --> 00:02:22,600
Wow, you finally picked up.

28
00:02:23,226 --> 00:02:24,435
How was your first day in Seoul?

29
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:29,524
- But why do you sound so tired?

30
00:02:30,608 --> 00:02:33,069
I just didn’t sleep well.

31
00:02:34,696 --> 00:02:36,573
You? Not sleeping well? That's new.

32
00:02:37,157 --> 00:02:38,116
What happened?

33
00:02:41,286 --> 00:02:42,745
I got a roommate.

34
00:02:43,955 --> 00:02:44,747
A roommate?

35
00:02:45,999 --> 00:02:47,750
Weren’t you gonna live alone?

36
00:02:48,668 --> 00:02:50,003
You said you signed a studio lease.

37
00:02:51,629 --> 00:02:53,798
Yeah, well...

38
00:02:54,132 --> 00:02:55,508
It got a little complicated.

39
00:02:57,427 --> 00:02:58,469
Don’t tell me...

40
00:02:59,304 --> 00:03:01,472
You didn’t get scammed, did you?

41
00:03:02,348 --> 00:03:03,099
Kind of.

42
00:03:03,808 --> 00:03:05,143
I’ll explain later.

43
00:03:06,227 --> 00:03:08,479
Alright, we’ll talk about that later.

44
00:03:09,022 --> 00:03:11,691
But I’ve got some big news for you.

45
00:03:13,193 --> 00:03:14,152
What is it?

46
00:03:15,111 --> 00:03:16,154
A blind date.

47
00:03:16,988 --> 00:03:17,488
What?

48
00:03:18,114 --> 00:03:21,201
Yeah, you're in Seoul now—you should meet new people.

49
00:03:22,619 --> 00:03:23,453
You’ve always just

50
00:03:23,786 --> 00:03:25,788
been stuck with home, studying, and part-time jobs.

51
00:03:28,249 --> 00:03:31,211
Still, going on a blind date your first day in Seoul...

52
00:03:32,337 --> 00:03:33,463
Nope, not weird at all.

53
00:03:33,922 --> 00:03:36,341
First dates should be on day one, duh.

54
00:03:38,134 --> 00:03:39,427
So, who is it?

55
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:42,555
Older woman, career type.

56
00:03:43,181 --> 00:03:45,683
Chic, tidy, and super competent.

57
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,854
Wait... why would someone like that wanna meet me?

58
00:03:50,897 --> 00:03:52,398
These days, blind dates—

59
00:03:52,398 --> 00:03:53,149
you know, instead of looking at photos—

60
00:03:53,608 --> 00:03:55,151
they’re all about blind meets.

61
00:03:55,693 --> 00:03:57,695
You just vibe and meet in person.

62
00:03:59,072 --> 00:04:00,615
Blind date, huh?

63
00:04:01,407 --> 00:04:02,825
Think I’ll be okay?

64
00:04:03,993 --> 00:04:05,912
Hey, trust me.

65
00:04:06,621 --> 00:04:08,623
I know your type.

66
00:04:08,873 --> 00:04:10,875
You’ll totally like her.

67
00:04:13,378 --> 00:04:15,129
Where’s the place, anyway?

68
00:04:15,755 --> 00:04:16,464
Tonight.

69
00:04:17,006 --> 00:04:17,840
7 PM.

70
00:04:18,299 --> 00:04:20,635
I’ll text you the place info right now.

71
00:04:21,761 --> 00:04:23,554
Anyway, good luck buddy.

72
00:04:30,853 --> 00:04:34,565
Older career woman, huh?

73
00:04:47,161 --> 00:04:49,580
- My first blind date in Seoul.

74
00:04:50,957 --> 00:04:53,334
- Never thought this day would come.

75
00:05:06,681 --> 00:05:08,182
Uh, excuse me...

76
00:05:08,808 --> 00:05:11,519
Are you my blind date by any chance?

77
00:05:18,526 --> 00:05:19,902
You...

78
00:05:23,531 --> 00:05:24,907
Sit down first.

79
00:05:39,339 --> 00:05:40,423
A blind date...

80
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:41,799
With you?

81
00:05:43,384 --> 00:05:44,719
I seriously had no idea.

82
00:05:44,719 --> 00:05:46,012
Really, I didn’t know.

83
00:05:46,012 --> 00:05:47,764
My friend set it up blind.

84
00:05:48,765 --> 00:05:50,183
Blind?

85
00:05:50,850 --> 00:05:52,852
So you don’t know who’ll show up?

86
00:05:53,603 --> 00:05:54,645
Exactly.

87
00:05:56,481 --> 00:05:57,940
Right, exactly.

88
00:05:58,441 --> 00:06:01,402
Why did it have to be me, though?

89
00:06:02,445 --> 00:06:03,780
Who knows?

90
00:06:05,281 --> 00:06:06,824
Maybe it’s a small world?

91
00:06:08,534 --> 00:06:10,328
If you're uncomfortable...

92
00:06:10,328 --> 00:06:11,162
I can just go...

93
00:06:11,204 --> 00:06:11,954
No.

94
00:06:13,414 --> 00:06:14,874
If anything...

95
00:06:15,375 --> 00:06:17,377
it'd be a waste of good drinks.

96
00:06:18,419 --> 00:06:19,420
Huh?

97
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,215
And this is weird.

98
00:06:24,384 --> 00:06:25,718
What is?

99
00:06:26,761 --> 00:06:28,805
You were stiff at home,

100
00:06:29,806 --> 00:06:31,557
but now you’re even more frozen.

101
00:06:33,017 --> 00:06:35,770
No, it’s not like that...

102
00:06:37,021 --> 00:06:38,022
It’s just—

103
00:06:38,898 --> 00:06:41,359
You’re acting like someone who kissed me in a dream or something.

104
00:06:42,735 --> 00:06:43,444
Huh?

105
00:06:44,278 --> 00:06:45,613
You... knew?

106
00:07:06,592 --> 00:07:08,052
What are you doing?

107
00:07:09,679 --> 00:07:12,974
You just seemed super tense, that’s all.

108
00:07:14,559 --> 00:07:15,476
By the way—

109
00:07:16,144 --> 00:07:17,562
What was your name again?

110
00:07:18,855 --> 00:07:21,566
Ah, I haven’t told you yet.

111
00:07:21,983 --> 00:07:22,692
Really?

112
00:07:23,109 --> 00:07:24,777
Then tell me now.

113
00:07:27,029 --> 00:07:28,281
Jung Ga-eun.

114
00:07:28,531 --> 00:07:29,949
I’m 23.

115
00:07:32,201 --> 00:07:34,328
I’m Yumi, 28.

116
00:07:34,996 --> 00:07:36,539
Your blind date for tonight.

117
00:07:39,500 --> 00:07:40,543
Oh, okay.

118
00:07:41,377 --> 00:07:43,212
So, let’s pretend we’re starting fresh?

119
00:07:44,755 --> 00:07:45,465
Sure.

120
00:07:47,341 --> 00:07:48,217
Great.

121
00:07:48,759 --> 00:07:49,927
Then...

122
00:07:50,553 --> 00:07:51,971
To our blind date—

123
00:07:53,473 --> 00:07:54,765
Shall we toast?

124
00:07:58,060 --> 00:08:00,146
Uh, yes.

125
00:08:04,817 --> 00:08:05,943
- Why me?

126
00:08:06,402 --> 00:08:07,778
- Why this situation?

127
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:11,949
- And why is my heart pounding like crazy?

128
00:08:16,787 --> 00:08:18,039
Ga-eun.

129
00:08:19,373 --> 00:08:20,041
Yeah?

130
00:08:20,541 --> 00:08:21,584
You nervous?

131
00:08:23,211 --> 00:08:26,547
Uh, yeah... this is my first time.

132
00:08:28,007 --> 00:08:28,966
First blind date?

133
00:08:29,717 --> 00:08:30,718
Or is it...

134
00:08:31,844 --> 00:08:33,721
because I’m the one sitting here?

135
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:37,016
Well...

136
00:08:40,770 --> 00:08:41,896
It’s okay.

137
00:08:42,563 --> 00:08:43,731
That nervous feeling...

138
00:08:44,357 --> 00:08:46,025
it’s not so bad.
